From e33b8e68bc776d5646a2f6c34d6ded2392a2b601 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:44:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] GLORYS gateway transports on GLORYS's own grid

glorys_gateways_native.jl replaces glorys_gateways_run.jl, which point-sampled
GLORYS onto the model grid (not transport-conserving at 1 degree). Each gateway
line becomes a staircase of faces between GLORYS's 1/12 degree cells; face
velocity is the mean of the two wet cells, bottom level cut at deptho. Also
reports GLORYS through the model's own staircase for each line, to separate
line placement from model error. plot_gateways.jl draws both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
